g counter near the tray\",\"sink\"); world w. Descend: for h in (0.12,0.06,0.03,0.015): solve_ik(w+[0,0,h],[0,0,1,0]); move_to_joints. Then open_gripper(); retreat solve_ik(w+[0,0,0.15],[0,0,1,0]).\n   Place ON the exact target: pick the deepest valid surface pixel of the target, not a far corner.\n5) TURN ON appliance AFTER the object is placed: obs; u,v=point_prompt_molmo(rgb, the control, e.g. \"stove knob\",\"burner knob\",\"toaster lever\"). world w. Push: for a vertical knob/lever, approach from in front: solve_ik(w+[-0.03,0,0],[0.7071,0,0.7071,0]) move; hold; if a knob, also try w+[-0.03,0,+0.02] and w+[-0.03,0,-0.02]. End with gripper open and >0.25 m away.\nOrientation: [0,0,1,0] fingers down; [0.7071,0,0.7071,0] forward; [1,0,0,0] up. solve_ik takes the grasp point between the fingertips (TCP offset applied internally); the returned joints are valid only if within ~0.6-0.8 m of the arm base.\n", "time": "02:30:00", "init_mode": "fresh"}, "timing_s": {"queued": 662, "run": 2565, "steps": null, "outside_steps": null}, "receipt": {"adapter": "note_tcomp_2", "curve": {"steps": [1], "score_mean": [0.0], "rollouts_per_step": 64, "zero_variance_frac": [null]}, "slopes": {"window_steps": 3, "last_3": null, "all": null}, "stop": {"state": "COMPLETED", "reason": "max_steps", "steps_run": 1, "steps_declared": 1, "adapter_step": 1}, "lineage": {"parent": null, "lineage": null, "kind": "fresh", "parent_lineage_id": null, "parent_checkpoint_id": null, "state_restored": false, "resume_from_step": null, "lineage_id": "L-2e121ec90b99", "checkpoint_id": "C-07531093f636"}, "seeds": {"range": [900001, 900008], "count": 64, "explicit": false, "lineage": null}, "evals": {"dev_evals": 0, "dev_evals_in_stacks": 0, "marker": "not evaluated"}}, "cost": {"basis": "canonical", "gpu_hours": {"charged_this_call": 0.7125, "charged_session": 10.4743, "reserved_running": 0.0, "available": 5.5257, "budget": 16.0, "measured_this_call": 0.7125, "charged_session_by_kind": {"train": 9.889, "ev